# Playwright and browser-driving agents.
# `test-results/` is Playwright's default `outputDir` (traces, videos, screenshots and
# `.last-run.json`) and `playwright-report/` its HTML reporter. `blob-report/` is the blob
# reporter a sharded CI run writes. `.playwright-mcp/` is where the Playwright MCP server
# drops the screenshots an agent takes while driving the app — none of the four is source,
# all four appear inside the repo the moment somebody runs a headed round, and one of them
# has already been left behind by a session that believed it had cleaned up.
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
.playwright-mcp/

# IDE — VS Code
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

